                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "This dataset contains the electromyographic and kinematic data of 16 warmblood horses. The objective were, primarily, to investigate the effect of full-limb flexion tests on static (flexed position) and dynamic (subsequent trot-up) muscle activity. Secondarily, to assess their effect on locomotion asymmetry during trotting."
